{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0154_1000_p", "source_sha256": "be7686dd01c186b1955e8016297b9d7bd9df477153ecd6fd265696a218e47e56", "ja": "（麗花が、新しい衣装の試着をしている。\nかなり熱心だけど、何か問題でもあったのかな？）", "zh": "（丽花正在试穿新服装。\n她看起来相当认真，是不是遇到什么问题了？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0154_1001_048rei", "source_sha256": "636959c19702fa21bed77525c10a6ebe18b369e8a85d11d3cc9d7a0821b7b602", "ja": "うーん、ズワイガニ……ウミウシ……\nハトもいいかな～♪　……あっ！", "zh": "嗯——帝王蟹……海牛……\n鸽子也不错呢～♪　……啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0154_1002_048rei", "source_sha256": "404cab76a47b66f863753ece6cbb689b54bae49d31e9ff80ded6e1d13aab68ee", "ja": "{$P$}さん、ナイスタイミングです♪\n質問してもいいですか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，来得正好♪\n我可以问您一个问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0154_1003_p", "source_sha256": "9bf13cc1964be7e819790ac36f06ea6ff5f89d6b9290ebade47f18dc183187d4", "ja": "もちろんいいけど、どうしたんだ？\n衣装に何か……。", "zh": "当然可以，不过怎么了？\n服装有什么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0154_1004_048rei", "source_sha256": "e1410e3ae0439fd17a4e6d628a33512b28521268fd98979f7ed472b0c1c6d43d", "ja": "{$P$}さんは、\nワラビーとセンザンコウ、どっちがいいですか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n沙袋鼠和穿山甲，你更喜欢哪一个呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0154_1006_p", "source_sha256": "e1790c7d67065b8b3ce851dc6c920956938db4460f345dab60c9583b5c1111b0", "ja": "なにが？", "zh": "什么哪样好？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0154_1007_048rei", "source_sha256": "be8a5b2095cbe325dca9cddbe9cf85f966d42426101dcf5a568946fffb86f0a4", "ja": "新しい干支の動物を考えてたんです。\n何がいいかな～って。", "zh": "我刚才在想新的生肖动物呢。\n在想选什么好呢～这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0154_1008_p", "source_sha256": "eeab33c1b9ae413ef4a820e9c4a64e4ae03e6bb5f7260a44a11175e5979b0b2e", "ja": "あ、そうだったのか。気づかなかった……。\nつまり、衣装に問題はないってことだよな？", "zh": "啊，原来是这样。我都没注意到……\n也就是说，服装没问题，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0154_1009_048rei", "source_sha256": "adccb6a19cba8ce58fab5031bb25920fe49a1887c749600ada1a00b4c69a31b4", "ja": "えっ、衣装ですか？\nもちろん、とってもとってもステキです！", "zh": "咦，是说服装吗？\n当然了，真的特别特别棒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0154_1010_048rei", "source_sha256": "c2b349925184b6e23234765610950553e8abd4603221454324fc8103f58f4a27", "ja": "豪華な感じですし、着心地もバッチリだし、\nすっかりお気に入りになっちゃいました♪", "zh": "感觉很华丽，穿起来也特别舒服，\n我已经彻底喜欢上这套衣服了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0154_1011_048rei", "source_sha256": "570d5dbf711ca837bbb2bfb79585db1847f06f0d89dfa2705a17b4e622f23cc2", "ja": "あっ！　よかったら{$P$}さんも\n着てみますか？　それなら脱ぎますけど……", "zh": "啊！你要是愿意的话，也可以试穿一下{$P$}先生哦？那样的话，我就脱下来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0154_1012_p", "source_sha256": "17775110e2da809371836130cbde4e2bdbb4ade29feb6eb5d3f459debda04541", "ja": "いや脱がなくていいよ！　サイズも合わないし！\n何より、それは麗花のための衣装だから。", "zh": "不用脱啦！尺寸也不合适！\n更重要的是，那是专门为丽花准备的服装。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0154_1013_048rei", "source_sha256": "3cf7dd6a47b162f844ba5ab613b6172c5a24d8dcc77c9d899cf143ace0a5d587", "ja": "私のため……。えへへ、なんだか嬉しいです♪\nありがとうございます、{$P$}さん！", "zh": "为了我……嘿嘿，感觉莫名地开心呢♪谢谢你，{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0154_1014_048rei", "source_sha256": "997dfdae6cb760520f88b1dc0825423e660cee30479f447569f137b1baa07918", "ja": "それで、オカピとセンザンコウなら、\nどっちがいいですか？", "zh": "那么，霍加狓和穿山甲，您更喜欢哪一个呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0154_1016_p", "source_sha256": "e1790c7d67065b8b3ce851dc6c920956938db4460f345dab60c9583b5c1111b0", "ja": "なにが？", "zh": "什么哪样好？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0154_1017_048rei", "source_sha256": "37f8fa9279a7e483f3e98af99401139d59ecdb33b9ef2891947af2be015b97c5", "ja": "だから新しい干支です。私と一緒に、ステージにバーン\nって飛び出したら、お正月は盛り上がりそうかなって♪", "zh": "所以就是新的生肖呀。要是和我一起“砰”地跳上舞台，感觉正月一定会很热闹呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0154_1018_p", "source_sha256": "876e8a25aa254c344033d0d1e460f3f5e67d67b0788492a84da0a88899910e7a", "ja": "あ、そういうことだったのか。うーん……\n甲乙つけがたいところだけど……。", "zh": "啊，原来是这么回事。嗯……\n真是难分高下啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0154_1019_048rei", "source_sha256": "89d13a634e72a43b263e822c0548e4931f197f768c9c077cfd7c0c095b22d65e", "ja": "ねーうしとらうーたつみ～うま～♪\nひつじさるとりいぬいーせんざんこ～♪", "zh": "鼠牛虎兔龙蛇～马～♪  \n羊猴鸡狗猪～穿山甲～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0154_1020_048rei", "source_sha256": "71580054a4f581533481758691835e2e1d2facd214a78a827b377a346e128cad", "ja": "あ、やっぱりセンザンコウの方が、\n語呂がよさそうです！", "zh": "啊，果然还是穿山甲更顺口！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0154_1021_p", "source_sha256": "f4f6115c11137427ce3c0dcf92df84325cacb8e1fa7cf76e827be45793625fce", "ja": "そうか……。よし、もし新しい干支を作ることに\nなったら、ふたりでセンザンコウを推そう！", "zh": "这样啊……好，要是以后真的要创造新的生肖，就由我们一起推荐穿山甲吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0154_1022_048rei", "source_sha256": "d26fa779bba52c60a0dc1f408610821e850d3178c7cbf4c0de64f671e9569c1d", "ja": "わーいわーい♪　一緒に頑張りましょうね！\nえいえい、おー！　センザン、コー！", "zh": "好耶好耶♪ 一起加油吧！\n加油，加油——穿山，甲！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0154_1023_p", "source_sha256": "13451b566a0aaf1e035df946fd968aa2c7314c86213511068cbb03f453434a8b", "ja": "（新しいアイディアがどんどん浮かんでくるらしい。\nそれだけ、衣装を気に入ってくれたのかもな！）", "zh": "（听说新的点子不断涌现出来。\n看来她真的很喜欢这套服装啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
